{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_15_level_st_15-01","groupId":"main_15","stageId":"st_15-01","title":"过去与现在的终点","storyCode":"15-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_st_15-01.txt","sourceHash":"e333f8277fffc32e7d778cb8d6233b24e380ad570235b400609483ca3935c1b8","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_white"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"50_g5_crackedhispdwarship"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>伦蒂尼姆外围战场，“荣光”号残骸</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些该死的源石真的斩断了这艘旗舰。我必须留在这里，加入这里的驻军继续战斗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我不能继续陪你往前走了，孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们一路过来，只有废墟和那些死去的......我没有看到任何驻军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，请不要叫我孩子！修道院的大伙已经为我的成年庆祝过了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，你的脾气还真像我的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到那边高处还闪着光芒的地方了吗？那是开斯特公爵阁下的“荣光”号的一部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那门舰炮还在运作，说明我从广播里接收到的通讯是真的。我原先的队伍既然隶属开斯特公爵阁下，现在自然该归队了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你的伤势......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有你帮忙治疗，我已经能走动路了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倒是你，你确定要继续往城里走吗？那是污染最严重的地方，活性源石环境会害死你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教爷爷说过，那位从矿场救下我的好心人为了送我回修道院，也吃了很多的苦，走过很多的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"救赎从来不是毫无代价的，我很早就清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用担心我，修士们教会了我很多避开危险的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我走到终点之前，只要能再多救一个人，任何一个人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说实话，我从来没有见过有哪一位修道院里的修士像你这样虔诚......谢谢你，维多利亚以你的善良为荣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"主教爷爷说，信仰并不是为了一己的荣誉......怀有信仰的人，是虔诚地相信，善举会将这片大地变得更好......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"变得更好吗......哈，或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但无论如何，谢谢你，小兔子，为你做的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能最后帮我一个忙吗，孩子？如果你回到了城里，我的家还在，我的女儿......也还在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"疲惫的伤员","speakerId":"avg_npc_423_1","isRemote":false,"text":"麻烦告诉她，爸爸一直在保护着她。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"维多利亚军人努力抬起受伤的手臂，向卡特斯敬了一个不甚标准的军礼，然后坦然地转身走向远处军舰的残骸，消失在源石的丛林里。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯望着远处舰炮上那抹淡淡的金光，不由得叹了一口气。\n远处炮火正响，小小的卡特斯继续向着天际线上的那座城市——伦蒂尼姆进发。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>伦蒂尼姆无名避难所</>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玛丽，戴维，请不要把这孩子藏在这里的事情告诉其他人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在城墙下遇到了他，他已经没有其他地方能去。他的父母都是伦蒂尼姆人，他说，很久以前你们在公园里见过面，不是吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满脸厌恶的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不记得了。但你帮了我们，我答应帮你忙。是帮你，不是帮他！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你们。他只会躲在这，不会乱跑，也不会出声。我保证他不会吓到任何人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（快速地点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很快就回来，我答应了一个人，要找到他的女儿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没法在外面保护你，外面街道上到处都是充满敌意的人——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我也找不到更好的地方暂时安置你。至少，这里许多人都接受过我的帮助，我相信这些孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"小萨卡兹紧紧拽住了卡特斯的手臂，却摸到了那些尖锐的源石结晶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他下意识地缩回了手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）对，对不起！我和爸爸妈妈在一起的时候......很少接触感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我会回来找你的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐惧的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_1456_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满脸厌恶的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"32_g5_ordnancefactory_ex"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请问......刚刚是你们在那些佣兵骚扰避难所时保护了这些人吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。我们这支小队里典范军和公爵联军的士兵都有，准备去圣王会西部大堂阵地时突然收到了求救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请相信，这场混乱马上就会结束了。也感谢您照顾这些孩子和避难的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，您在找什么人吗？"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯摇了摇头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我们顺便也清理了一下周围躲着的魔族佬，他们眼看快败了，也想躲起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"兴奋的军人","speakerId":"avg_npc_409_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再会，我们得赶去前线了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没看到那个孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满脸厌恶的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......跟我来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"孩子带着卡特斯穿过工厂层层叠叠的掩体，卡特斯看到避难所的其他人沉默地搬运着萨卡兹的尸体。\n走到一堆集装箱之前，孩子费力地挪开了凌乱的遮掩。\n那个蜷缩的萨卡兹孩子惊恐地看着他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满脸厌恶的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"满脸厌恶的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_661_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我答应过帮你。刚才事情比较突然，我也没有其他地方能藏他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沉默的孩子","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"但他不能继续留在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......回来的路上我遇到了一支名叫整合运动的队伍，他们可以收留这个孩子。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini01_westlobbysquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放心，那个孩子我们会照顾好的——但是你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的感染状况很糟糕......你应该和我们一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......还有其他的事没有做完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我不会勉强你，你和我认识的很多同伴很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合运动成员","speakerId":"avg_npc_729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些抑制剂和防护装备我留给你了。再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":"avg_npc_1729_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......再见。"},{"type":"narration","text":"远处，维多利亚人前仆后继地向食腐者之王最后的阵地走去，生命在消逝。\n那不是她的战争，她感到恐惧，她也无法理解支撑这些人克服死亡恐惧的力量来源于何处。\n但她希望救下更多的人，继续麻木地救下更多的人......一个又一个。\n......哪怕只是徒劳。\n她想起离开修道院那天，主教与她坐在河畔教堂外的告别。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你问，何为信仰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......我年轻游历时曾去过伊比利亚，我亲眼目睹过大静谧下身边人生活的崩溃，但那个顽强的国家却从未彻底屈服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"起初，我只是在为那个国家的生命力而赞叹，但随着我活过的岁月越来越久，我才逐渐醒悟......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那样的生命力，就是信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"有谁教育过我，或是其他那些伊比利亚人，我们应该何去何从？有谁曾许诺过，我们一定会跨过那样恐怖的灾难？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"没有，但我们总会在灾难面前说服我们自己。我们经历的一切总有意义，苦难终有尽头，我们会有一个美好的未来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这就是信仰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信仰不在经文上，也不在祷告词和赞美诗当中，而是在我们的生命中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"信仰在我们的身体和思维中，在我们的心脏的每一次律动中，在一呼一吸之中。是我们一切力量的来源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"主教","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......只因为我们相信。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主教爷爷。如果真如您所说，一切苦难终归是有尽头的，那个美好的将来，又在何处呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"主教爷爷......我应该，已经尽力了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯疲惫地倒在废墟中，听到远处传来的炮火声和隐隐的哭喊。\n剧烈的疼痛提醒着她这副身体已经行至终点的残酷事实。\n她向周围那些被她从死亡前救下的人招了招手，独自留在远离其他人的空旷处。\n她的身体开始崩解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"坚强的感染者","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我愿意去相信......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"卡特斯眼睛所能捕捉到的光越来越黯淡，直至陷入漫长的黑夜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"然后她看到似乎有人握住了她近乎破碎的手，光线开始重新涌回她的眼睛。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"58_mini01_westlobbysquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"阿米娅，怎么了？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我好像听到了，感染者发生崩解的声音......又一次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我几乎都能远远看见离去的人最后时刻迸发的光芒，距离我们并不远。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这段时间，我们已经见过太多次......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"走吧。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"该去结束这一切了。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我们去面对特雷西斯。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"avg_1037_amiya3_1","isRemote":false,"text":"博士？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"凯尔希，我突然有一个疑问。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"源石内化宇宙中的静滞......到底意味着什么？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我们曾涉足的那个地方，是不是连时间都无法逃脱？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"narration","text":"信息的浪涌冲击着他，试图将他吞没。\n但特雷西斯屹立不动。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我终于亲眼看到了你创造的伟绩，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<p=1>源石内化宇宙</><p=2>未知时间</>\n他抬头望向矗立在虚空中的高塔，崩溃的碎屑重新化作无序的信息回归虚空。\n特雷西斯握住了飘散而下的碎屑，可手中转瞬却又一无所有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你为我打开了这扇门，最后这段路，我会替你走完，特蕾西娅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"夺下这枚属于萨卡兹的源石，萨卡兹将第一次拥有自己主宰自己命运的权力。"},{"type":"narration","text":"他握紧了手中的剑，冷冷地注视着虚空中那逐渐靠近的巨大菱形。\n随即，他走向了崩溃的塔。他很清楚，他将要面对的存在就在那里。\n毁灭些什么，来铸造阶梯。特蕾西娅已为他留下了道路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"一如过往，你为我指引方向，我的剑会开辟前路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"特雷西斯","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我未曾食言，特蕾西娅——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"他走上了阶梯，走向了濒临崩毁的塔之巅。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
